"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716940/extras/b10237e77547c7d4892426063e6110a8.poster.avif?t=1680892517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716940/extras/b10237e77547c7d4892426063e6110a8.webm?t=1680892517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716940/extras/b10237e77547c7d4892426063e6110a8.mp4?t=1680892517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
